  "primer": {
    "$comment": "Solarized (dark) palette for gen-primer-theme. Source: https://ethanschoonover.com/solarized (MIT) — base03 #002b36 … base3 #fdf6e3, yellow #b58900, orange #cb4b16, red #dc322f, magenta #d33682, violet #6c71c4, blue #268bd2, cyan #2aa198, green #859900. Base: @primer/primitives dark. Canvas base03, raised base02, text base1 / muted base0, accent + link blue (link lightened to #4a9fe0 for 4.5:1), success green, danger red (text lightened), attention yellow, severe orange, done violet, sponsors magenta. Solarized has nothing darker than base03 and no shades between base02 and base01, so inset/shadow (#00212b) and the border steps are derived.",
